Description: Sleek and minimal desktop shell for Wayland
 Noctalia Shell is a beautiful, minimalist desktop shell thoughtfully
 crafted for Wayland, built with the Quickshell framework.
 .
 Features include:
  - Support for multiple Wayland compositors (Hyprland, Sway, Niri, labwc)
  - Customizable panels, dock, and desktop widgets
  - Media controls and audio visualization
  - Theming with multiple color schemes
  - Multi-monitor support
 .
 Note: This package requires Quickshell to be installed separately.
 Quickshell is not available in Debian repositories and must be built
 from source: https://github.com/quickshell-mirror/quickshell
